# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — SWIG Python 扩展绕过 autotools 直驱 setup.py ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-06
# Software: gpgmepy 2.0.0 (任何上游用 autotools + setup.py build 构建 SWIG Python 扩展的包)
# Gate: conan create build()
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     E1973
trigger_tool:           setup.py|setup.py.in|autotools|automake|libtool|configure
phase:                  build
error_signature:        automake: command not found|libtool: command not found|AC_CONFIG_FILES.*setup\.py
severity:               2
category:               build-system, python, swig
match_keywords:         automake,libtool,setup.py,SWIG,swig,autotools,configure,AC_CONFIG_FILES,placeholder
root_cause:             OHOS PC 开发环境不提供 automake 和 libtool（仅 bare clang + make），而上游
                        SWIG Python 扩展的构建流程依赖 autotools 生成 setup.py。configure.ac 用
                        AC_CONFIG_FILES([setup.py]) 声明 setup.py.in 的模板替换，但 automake 缺失
                        时 aclocal/configure 均失败。
affected_scope:         所有在 OHOS 上用 autotools + SWIG 构建 Python 扩展的包（gpgmepy、pygpgme
                        等）；也适用于任何上游用 autotools 生成 setup.py 但目标环境缺 automake 的场景
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           autotools-bypass-substitution
rec_description:        在 Conan 配方的 build() 中用 Python 字符串替换模拟 autotools 的模板生成，
                        直接从 setup.py.in 生成 setup.py，跳过 configure/aclocal/automake
rec_command:            python3 -c "t=open('setup.py.in').read(); open('setup.py','w').write(
                        t.replace('@VERSION@','1.0').replace('@GPGME_CFLAGS@','-I/inc').replace(
                        '@GPGME_LIBS@','-L/lib -lgpgme'))"
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               配方内 Python 字符串替换，无需 patch 文件
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      安装 automake/libtool（如有 OHOS 包可用）
fallback_description:   OHOS 无官方 automake/libtool 包，此路径不可行
fallback_command:       ohpm install automake libtool
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          不推荐
principles:               
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-7939-gpgmepy-swig-setup-py-bypass.kv
last_updated:           2026-09-06
source_event:           gpgmepy 2.0.0 OHOS 适配，configure 失败因缺少 automake
authors:                AtomCode
source_pr:              #7939
verification_cmd:       # 以 source_pr CI 门禁为准（PR #7939）
